  "reason": "The evidence strongly points to scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l as the best encoder pair (config_022: 0.725, config_027: 0.706), and transformer aggregation outperforms avgpool (0.725 vs 0.706). Weighted fusion has been preferred over concat in prior comparisons (0.635 vs 0.629 with pca_n2000), but that gap was small and tested under different conditions. Config_050 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + transformer + concat) is the only untested variant in the top-performing family. Testing it clarifies whether concat fusion could match or exceed weighted when paired with transformer aggregation and the strongest encoders. With only 2 experiments remaining after this, confirming the optimal fusion method within the best family is the highest-value uncertainty to resolve before committing final experiments to fine-tuning or confirming the overall best configuration."
}

